archive/

# Credentials and local config are not the website.
#
# This deploys the directory, so anything sitting here can be served. `vercel
# link` writes .env.local with a live OIDC token in it, and some of these carry
# more than that. Vercel excludes these by default; this says so rather than
# relying on it.
.env*
.vercel

# The favicon source archive. The cut files beside it are the website; the zip
# they came out of is not, and this directory is served as it stands.
assets/*.zip
